 * repo and create-mn-app --template bboard stay. This file does not invent
 * APIs and does not claim a public indexer or node fix.
 *
 * Official examples page (still live as of 2026-10-20) publishes the
 * bulletin board contract with pragma language_version 0.23 and these
 * asserts (not invented):
 *   Attempted to post to an occupied board
 *   Attempted to take down post from an empty board
 *   Attempted to take down post, but not the current owner
